# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform. Several checks compare a generated
# file with the file on disk byte for byte (api/wrapped-copy.js, website/api.html,
# api/coach/core/prompts.js), and a CRLF checkout of a Windows clone made them fail without
# anything being out of date.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Shell scripts and container files keep Unix line endings on every checkout, Windows included:
# a CRLF in a script's #! line makes the container report "not found" at start-up (#1025).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.template text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
**/Dockerfile text eol=lf
frontend/android/gradlew text eol=lf
